target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn post analytics</a></=
p><p>Do not optimize for a supposed secret algorithm. Your practical questi=
on is whether the content reaches developers who want the advertised projec=
t.</p><h3>YouTube as a searchable teaching sample</h3><p>Start with two sub=
stantial tutorials per month, drawn from the same projects you are already =
teaching. Make the smallest useful video for the problem; duration is a res=
ult of the explanation, not a target.</p><p>Begin with the finished behavio=
r, name the prerequisites, explain the hardest part, and show a failure and=
