s not match the promise</td><td>Ask five relevant visitors what they expect=
ed</td></tr><tr><td>Leads but low attendance</td><td>Timing, weak reminder,=
 or low urgency</td><td>Offer a clear project outcome and an asynchronous o=
ption</td></tr><tr><td>Attendance but few paid starts</td><td>Weak fit, pro=
of, offer, or pricing</td><td>Ask nonbuyers what prevented the decision</td=
></tr><tr><td>Paid starts but low activation</td><td>Setup friction or prer=
