parate research participants from marketing subscribers.</p><h3>The member =
outcome tracker</h3><p>Member identifier; intake; tier; actual recurring pr=
ice; source; prerequisite check; first artifact date; review status; projec=
t completion; rubric result; first renewal date; renewal result; cancellati=
on reason; support minutes; case-study permission.</p><p>This tracker ties =
marketing to delivery. A channel is useful when its members learn and contr=
ibute economically, not merely when it produces signups.</p><h3>The weekly =
