What cash obligations fall due in the next 13 weeks?</li><li>Which single b=
ottleneck deserves the next experiment?</li><li>What work should stop this =
week?</li></ol><h3>The universal community creation process</h3><p>First, c=
hoose a reachable person with a costly or frustrating problem. Investigate =
recent behavior. Define a result and verify that you can teach it. Sell a s=
mall, clear pilot before making a large library.</p><p>Then deliver, inspec=
t actual artifacts, and identify the obstacles that repeat. Convert repeate=
d explanations into reusable instruction. Preserve the human work that need=
