priate buyers. Connect each source to activation, outcomes, renewals, and c=
ontribution. Improve the weakest meaningful stage.</p><p>Finally, scale the=
 work that already functions. Train other people using explicit standards, =
increase capacity before intake, and add adjacent offers only when they sol=
ve a demonstrated need.</p><p>That process transfers to AI, software engine=
ering, freelancing, cloud delivery, and future niches. The subject changes;=
 the questions about buyer progress, evidence, delivery, distribution, and =
economics remain.</p></section><section id=3D"section-25"><h2>25 Sources an=
